              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "> ⚠️ This endpoint is in [public preview](/preview/roadmap).\n\nCreate a generic deployment that uses capacity already owned in a pool, or a spot deployment that buys capacity for a specific instance SKU at or below a maximum rate."
